New Feed Forest Probe =E2=80=94 Baseline 2026-09-20 15:10 Executive delta

This first baseline found one strong PLANT candidate, two PILOT/WATCH
candidates, and several important exclusions. The strongest immediately
collectible feed is the DfE Find an Apprenticeship Display Advert API v2:
it became the required version by 1 April 2026 and newly represents
apprenticeships available at multiple locations. This is unusually useful
for UKGraph because adverts are ephemeral demand observations while the new
location structure improves geographic resolution.

The most strategically interesting near-future feed is DEFRA Digital Waste
Tracking, but it is NOT yet a public read feed: the Receipt API is
primarily authenticated submission infrastructure. Do not treat it as
collectable national movement data yet. Monitor for public/aggregate read
access and Phase 2 expansion.
