collectors already operate. Still useful as UKGraph input.

WATCH ORR Public Consumption API: ORR awarded a =C2=A355k contract for an
external machine-readable API over its data lakehouse and stated in 2026
that it intended to launch/expand it. Need current endpoint verification
before promotion.

WATCH DfT API programme: on 2 June 2026 DfT published a discovery making
APIs the default delivery channel for transport data and an enabler of
real-time services. This is a meta-signal: monitor the DfT estate for
individual datasets transitioning from periodic files to APIs, especially
where new real-time fields appear.
